<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Bekwel Bible</book>
  <para style="toc3">Efɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efɛɛz</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl, pɛ daa Bot ɛ dɛl ɛ Efɛɛz</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl pɛ dáa Bot ɛ dɛl ɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Efɛɛz</para>
  <para style="iot">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl pɛ daa bot ɛ ghaada Efɛɛz, nakwyalaa ɛ étɛp ezɛɛga bot di pɛ kyee dik Azi, ye kadi edjóoaa mos Tuulki ɛ. Mɛkana tak nakwyalaa ɛ, nyɛy e membok (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 3:1">3.1</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:1">4.1</ref></char>), mɛkana mɛ tak ɛpekaada nɛ ɛsɛɛg bɛmɛlyo mɛ mɛsik ɛ Pɔl pɛ daa ezɛɛga mendjaa mendjaala menek. Mɛkana tak lii ɛ nɛ bot di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tin, ɛsuk ɛ mɛkana mak nɛ bot ɛ ghaada Efɛɛz ye ɛ́ dum nɛ sa Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛsa ɛ. Tin, ye ɛ́ sa wat di náá, ye nabɛ ɛ́ syela ee Yezu eezɛsa náá bot gu yɛ. E geka ɛsa etɛp binek, nadi ye ɛ́ tak, tin, eezɛnyen nɛ Yezu Klisto. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ dum nɛ mɛkɛn mɛ bhwak, gwoo nɛ bɔs. Ye ɛpelii dum nɛ ɛgwakel pak bot ɛ di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs nɛ ɛgwakel pak bot nɛ Zɛɛb. Tin, tɔ sa nyɛ nadi ekwyɛl ɛsa yenek, zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ boo di. É sok mot nakwyal mɛkana mak di elii étɛp zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala ɛ, ye ɛ́ étɛp sa nadhaa tɔ ezɛɛga mendjaa mendjaala mɛ kyee e dik binek, di edhaa bɛ nyel ɛ. Deenek, zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala ɛ dáa nyel ɛ Klisto. Nyel tak ààkat ɛwyee, nyɛ ɛ́ daa ndjaa nazesumaa nɛ Klisto ɛ. Tin, ekeletyɛ tetɔ́ nɛ ɛsum ɛ yɛ. Ndjaa tak ɛ sama wat nɛ Klisto tɔ ghwyil mɛbwala tyee wat dáa moma di sama wat nɛ ngom'ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tɔ bɛmɛlaŋel yii mɛkɛn kɛyaka nɛ yii elɛl (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 1-3">1—3</ref></char>), mot nakwyal mɛkana ɛpebasal kɔ ɛsu ɛgwalel dika nyen mos'aak, etɛɛ náá, Yezu nadjɛ tsik'ɛ kɔ mɛlaaba. Ekeletyɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, moo ɛ́ bot ɛ mbyak wat nɛ ekeletyɛ di tɔ dhaad mbyak eYuda ɔ. E di'enek, bɔɔ djas zoobelaa ɛ enɛm esa wat e Zɛɛb. Tin, Klisto naazebwak pap syen, nyɛ eesɛɛg bot ɛ nadi koko ààdi edi wat ɔ. E di'enek, nyɛ eedjɛ bɔɔ djas egwyem.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tɔ mɛlaŋel yii ená kɛyaka nɛ etɛn nɛ wat (4-6), mot nakwyal mɛkana ɛpelɛɛ nɛ ekeletyɛ ɛ́ náá, bɛ baal ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ ɛgwakel zɛnɔɔ egwyem ee Zɛɛb di edjɛ bɛ ɛ. Deenek, mɛghaaz ɛpedjɛaa bɛ étɛp bɛ needi nɛ mɛfulu na bes. Mot nakwyal mɛkana ɛpedjɛ mɛlyo dáa bot di egoka nɛ ɛdi tɔ mɛbyel mɔɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 5:21">5.21</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:9">6.9</ref></char>). Étɛp ɛmɛt ɛ mɛlyo mak ɛnyɔɛpe ɛ, wɔ goka ɛ́ nɛ gu dáa bot ɛ na mwa nadidi ɛ. Tin, mɛtiŋ nabɛ ɛ́ ɛ náá, boa goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛlooba nɛ botom bɔɔ. Botom nabɛ ɛ́ ekukuma bɔɔ. Mot nakwyal mɛkana mak lii daŋ-daŋ ɛ nɛ botom, yɛ bɛ náá, bɛ ekukuma ɔɔ, bɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi dáa Klisto, mot nadjɛ tsik'ɛ ɔ. Deenek, yɛ aadi ɛ́ tyee sa na bes bot ɛ ɛlɛɛ nɛ botom náá, kwyɛlka bɛl bin (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 5:25-33">5.25-33</ref></char>) Deenek, yɛ aadi ɛ́ tyee sa bes é ghɛŋ na mwa, wɔ lɛɛ nɛ ekukuma náá, bɛ nɛ kukuma pɛ tɔ gwoo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 6:9">6.9</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="s">Mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>Ye ɛ́ mam Pɔl, mot-lwoma ɛ Yezu Klisto tɔ ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb. Mɛ kwyal mɛkana mak ɛ étɛp bɔɔ Zɛɛb di pɛ ghaada Efɛɛz ɛ, bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Yezu Klisto ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>Beta náá, Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'enaka nɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto djɛ bin enɛm nɛ embɛɛ nɛ egwyem.<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Enɛm esa ɛ Zɛɛb étɛp bot ɛ mbyak'ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>Duu nɛ Zɛɛb, Sɛɛg ɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto. Ye ɛ́ nyɛy naazesɛɛ mena mɛtel. Mɛtel mɛ tak nasɛɛaa mena kɔ ɛ su ɛ membi esonok di dus tɔ gwoo ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, menaka ɛ́ tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Klisto. <verse eid="EPH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>Tin, ɛsok nɛ bhwak nɛ kusel, Zɛɛb naazeloozesɛ́ɛ mena étɛp mena needika bot bɛ, étɛp mena needi dɛɛ ààbɛ nɛ ɛbɛk. Tɔ boo lyem kwyɛl'ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>Zɛɛb naaloozemyam náá, nyɛ aasa náá, mena dika bɔɔ bɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu Klisto. Ye ɛ́ deenek ɛ nyɛ nakwyɛl náá, ye sael tɔ ɛkwosak ɛ lɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>Djhoodjɛka duu nɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛkɛɛ nyɛ nazedjɛ mena nɛ lyem wat kɔ ɛsu ɛ Mɔn'ɛ nyɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ.<verse eid="EPH 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/>Ye ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ghiya ɛ Klisto ɛ, menabɛlka di pɛka. Tin, mesyem mena eebaapelaa, Zɛɛb naatel mena dáa enɛm nɛ embɛɛ bɛ di ebɔk ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>Nyɛ naalwoodal mena nɛ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ bɛ, étɛp mena needika bot ɛ etsoŋ, nɛ bot ɛ mɛtsel dhaa nyel. <verse eid="EPH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>Tin, nyɛ eesa náá, mena guka sa nyɛ nadi kwyɛl ɛsa ɛ. Deenek, esa e tak nabɛ ɛ́ dinaa syela ɛ. Mɛsa mɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ yɛ aasael ɛ nɛ Klisto. <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>Sa tak ɛ yii Zɛɛb aasa é ghɛŋ mɛlu aadjala ɛ, yɛ aadi ɛ́ ɛsɛɛg esa djas di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs nɛ yii di tɔ gwoo ɛ, etɛɛ náá, Klisto needi kukuma esa binek djas.<verse eid="EPH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Tɔ ɛgwakel ɛ lena nɛ Klisto, mena nabelaka ɛkɛɛ nakɛkaa mena ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb naazeloosɛ́ɛ mena tɔ ɛkwosak ɛ lɛ. Tin, Zɛɛb sa esonok djas ɛ dáa nyɛ di ekwyɛl ɛ, nɛ dáa nyɛ di ekwos ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>Menabɛlka, bot nadi bot ɛ mɛkɛn é ɛwa ɛbwaalel ɛ lena nɛ Klisto ɔ, djhoodjɛka duu nɛ Zɛɛb etɛɛ náá, nyɛ boo kukuma. <verse eid="EPH 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Biyɔ pe, bhis bi nagwak mɛkpa mɛ etsɛɛtsɛ ɛ, Mbɛɛ Bhaadal nadjɛ bin tsik ɛ, bi naadum koŋ nɛ Klisto. Dáa bi nadum koŋ nɛ nɛ ɛ, Zɛɛb naawa geka yɛ kɔ len. Geka tak ɛ, Sisim na Dɛɛ ee nyɛ nakɛk bin ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>Sisim na Dɛɛ ɛpedjɛ mena ɛbwaalel ɛ esa ee Zɛɛb nakwom étɛp bot ɛ mbyak'ɛ. Tin, nyɛ lɛɛ nɛ nena ɛ náá, menabɛlka bot ɛ di bot bɛ ɔ, mena aabelaka ye ɛ́, é sok mena aadika mena moo pɛka ɔ. Tin, mena aamyaalaka nɛ duma Zɛɛb.<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mendjaala ɛ Pɔl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Ye ɛ́ dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ dinaa, mɛ naagwak dáa bot nadi elii kɔ ɛsu ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu ɛ, dɔɔ nɛ kwyɛl bi baadi nɛ yɛ nɛ bot djas zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>Deenek, mɛ ààkat ɛbulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ len. Mɛ nɛ taala nɛ nen tɔ mendjaala mam. <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>Mɛ ɛpedjaala nɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg mot duma, Sɛɛg ɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto. Nyɛ djɛ bin Sisim etsoŋ, ye neetel bin étɛp bi neegu nyɛ ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>Tin, mɛ ɛpebaadjaala étɛp Zɛɛb neebɛɛ bin mis tɔ mɛkas mɛ, étɛp bi neegu mɛbɔk mɛ ɛbwaalel ɛ nyɛ djóo bin étɛp tak ɛ. Deenek, étɛp bi neegu mɛnyɔ mɛ esa e lyak ee nyɛ aadjɛ nɛ bot ɛ mbyak na dɛɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19"/>Bi neegu mɛbɔk mɛ mɛbwala mɛ nyɛ di nɛ yɛ étɛp menabɛlka bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ nɛ ɔ. Tin, mɛbwala mɛ tak ɛ ye ɛ́ yii Zɛɛb nabatalyaal yɛ nɛ ghwyil djas ɛ, <verse eid="EPH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20"/>é ghɛŋ nyɛ nagomal Klisto pak myoŋ ɛ. Bhii tak, nyɛ naadil nyɛ é mbɔ eghɛŋ bɛ tɔ gwoo. <verse eid="EPH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>Klisto naanɛɛgaa kɔ efofop djas, kɔ esisim djas, kɔ ghwyil djas, kɔ mɛbwala djas. Din ɛ Klisto ɛ di ekɔk kɔ min djas di kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɛ, ààkobɛ-bɛak e bhwak bot di'ak, ye ɛ́ dɔɔ nɛ bhwak di ezyɛ ɛ́. <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/>Zɛɛb eesa Klisto kɔk kɔ esonok djas, nyɛ naadjɛ eghɛŋ tɔ zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala étɛp nyɛ needi kɔk kɔ esonok djas di nɛ tsik ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/>Zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala ɛ dáa nyel ɛ Klisto. Tin, Klisto ɛ́ tɔ lɔɔ, ye ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ di lwoodal esonok djas tɔ bot djas.<verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ɛdus tɔ ɛsyee, da bela tsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>Eghɛŋ sok, bi nadi ɛ́ dáa bot ɛ zegwyɛ ɔ kɔ ɛsu ɛdjak ɛ len nɛ mesyem men. <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>Bi nadi ɛ́ si bhel mbee mɛfulu mɛ bot ɛ bɔs'ak. Bi naadu kukuma embee esisim di tɔ gwoo ɛ. Sisim tak ɛ di esa náá, bot djas di ààlooba nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ di si bhel ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Tin, menabɛlka djas nasesaka esonok ɛ dáa bɔɔ. Mena nasesaka esonok ɛ dáa gwyes epuud nɛ embee esimza bina nadi elwom mena ɛ. Deenek, kana mɛbyel mena, ye nabela Zɛɛb naazekpaa lyem kɔ ɛsu ɛlena, dáa nyɛ nakpaa lyem nɛ bot ɛ sok ɛ.<verse eid="EPH 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Tin, Zɛɛb ɛ boo lyem ghoŋ, nyɛ nɛ kwyɛl mena ɛbuɛpe dhaa nyel. <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>Ye ɛ́ dum nɛ kwyɛl tak ɛ, nyɛ nasa náá, mena baadika nɛ tsik sama wat nɛ Klisto. Dáa dinaa mena nadika ɛ mena eezegwyɛka étɛp ɛdjak ɛ lena ɛ, Zɛɛb natsik mena ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ bɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>Zɛɛb naagomal mena lɔɔg wat nɛ Yezu Klisto pak bɛmyoŋ, étɛp ɛdjɛ mena di sama nɛ nɛ pɛ tɔ gwoo. <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>Nyɛ eesa mena enɛm kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu Klisto, étɛp ɛlyaal nɛ bot aazyɛ djɛmɛn ɔ ɛ náá, mɛvu mɛ nɛ bɔk dhaa esonok djas. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8"/>Ye ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ Zɛɛb ɛ bi nabela tsik, tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ nɛ. Ye tok etɛɛ náá, bi naasa dhiiti sonok, nyɛ djɛ bin enɛm nɛ embɛɛ bɛ ɛ́ e toto. <verse eid="EPH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9"/>Ye tok etɛɛ náá, bi ɛpesa dhiiti enɛm esa. Tin, nyɛ djɛ bin ye ɛ́ e toto, ye nabɛ ɛ́ etɛɛ náá, bot needi ààbɛ nɛ ɛghɛɛ nyel. <verse eid="EPH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Menaka ɛ́ bot ɛ Zɛɛb nakus ɔ. Dáa dinaa nyɛ nakus mena ɛ, nyɛ nakus mena ɛ, étɛp mena neesa embɛɛ mɛsa mɛ bot ɛ di tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Yezu Klisto ɛ di egoka nɛ ɛsa ɛ. Ye ɛ́ embɛɛ mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb nalookɛk náá, mena aasa ɛ.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbyak wat tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Yezu Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Taalaka nɛ sa mɛ nalɛɛ nɛ nen é ghɛŋ sok ɛ. Ɛsok nɛ bi nɛ byel, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda. Bot ɛ dhaad mbyak eYuda nadi edjóo bin ɛ «bot ɛ nadi ààni beka ɔ». Bɔɔ kadjóoaa ɛ «bot ɛ zeni beka ɔ» yɛ bɛ náá, bɛ nadjóoaa ɛ «bot ɛ zeni beka ɔ» yɛ dum nɛ geka bot ɛ bɔs wa bin e mɛnyel ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>Eghɛŋ tak, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi sama nɛ Klisto, bi nabɛ ɛ́ bɛdjoŋ tɔ dhaad mbyak Yisalaɛl. Tin, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààlaŋa tɔ sama bot ɛ nadi tɔ ɛgwakel étɛp ekɛk e Zɛɛb ɛ. É di'enek, bi nabɛ ɛ́ kɔ bɔs di ààbɛ nɛ ɛbwaalel ɛ, bɔs di ààbɛ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Biyɔ bot ɛ nadi é ghɛŋ sok ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ Yezu Klisto ɔ. Nenak yak, bi moo ɛ́ bi eezekunaa nɛ nɛ. Nyɛ naso ghiya yɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ len étɛp bi neekunaa nɛ nɛ.<verse eid="EPH 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ di egwyem'enaka. Nyɛy mot nasa náá, bot ɛ mbyak eYuda nɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, bɛ di dhaad mbyak wat. É sok nyɛ naka nyel'ɛ ɛ, nyɛ naabwak pap mɛbhuka nadi ewa mbɛk pak membyak menek ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/>Tin, dum nɛ ɛsyee ɛ lɛ, nyɛ naadis etsi nɛ mɛtiŋ mɛ eYuda étɛp ɛsa náá, bot ɛ mbyak eYuda nɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, bɛ di bɛ moo bot ɛ mbyak wat tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ nɛ. Ye ɛ́ deenek ɛ, nyɛ nawa egwyem tɔ membyak mɛba menek. <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>Kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛsyee ɛ lɛ é mɛlaaba, Klisto naasɛɛg bɔɔ djas é nyel wat, da bulal bɛ tɔ kwyɛl nɛ Zɛɛb. Ye ɛ́ tin é mɛlaaba ɛ, nyɛ nadis ɛbhina nadi pak'ɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/>Klisto nazyɛ ɛ́ étɛp ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal e egwyem pɛ daa biyɔ bot ɛ nadi ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ Zɛɛb, dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ nadi ɛkunaaɛpe nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>E di'enek, kɔ ɛsu ɛ Klisto, menabɛlka djas bot ɛ di bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, nɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. Tin, menaka ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil katɔ́ pɛ daa Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'ena, kɔ ɛsu mɛbwala mɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ yenek.<verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Dáa di deenek ɛ, biyɔ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, bi tokapɛ bɛdjoŋ. Bi tokapɛ bot ɛ dus pɛ kyee mɛdhik mɛsis ɔ. Bi moo ɛ́ bot ɛ mbyak e dɛɛ. Bi moo ɛ́ bot ɛ mɛbyel ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Bi moo ɛ́ bi moo bi eezebeega nyɔ'ak kɔ sɔ étɛp ɛsum ndjaa. Deenek, mɛkok mɛ ɛsuk ɛ zumal ndjaa tak ɛ bot ɛ lwoma nɛ bɛngoolel-mɛkpa Zɛɛb. Yezu Klisto, nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet kadi ɛ́ ɛkok di epyet ndjaŋ ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Nyɛy ɛ́ di epyet ndjaa djas, nyɛ ɛben epap tak étɛp ye needi di na Dɛɛ ɛ Ghɛŋ. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>Tɔ ɛgwakel ɛ len nɛ Yezu Klisto ɛ, biyɔ pe eezesɛɛga nɛ bɛdhiiti bot étɛp ɛsum ndjaa tak, ndjaa Sisim Zɛɛb aadi tɔ tak ɛ.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Mɛsa mɛ Pɔl pɛ daa bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ, mam Pɔl, ɛpedjaala Zɛɛb. Mam mot di mot membok étɛp mɛsa mɛ Yezu Klisto ɔ. Mɛ wak mos e membok ɛ, etɛɛ náá, mɛ naakɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal pɛ daa len bot di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>Ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bi naazegwak mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb nadjɛ étɛp ɛlyaal ɛ bin embɛɛ etɛp bɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>Zɛɛb naatel mɛ ɛkwosak ɛ lɛ nadi syela ɛ. Ye ɛ́ dáa mɛ nakwyal bin yɛ sok ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/>Laŋa bi aalaa ye ɛ́, biyɔ pe waagu etɛp dinaa mɛ eezegu ɛ. Ye ɛ́ esonok dinaa yɛ syela dum nɛ Klisto ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>Eghɛŋ na mwa, Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́ ààtel bot etɛp nadi tɔ sɔ ɛ. Nenak, nyɛ eesa náá, Sisim yɛ naalyaal popoopwon nɛ bot ɛ lwoma yɛ, nɛ bɛngoolel-mɛkpa Zɛɛb na Dɛɛ, bot ɛ di étɛp mɛsa mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>Beeka sa nadi tɔ sɔ ɛ: kɔ ɛsu ɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal, esa e lyak ee Zɛɛb nadjɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɛ. Biyɔ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, biyɔ pe aabaabela yɛ. Biyɔ nɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda, bi moo ɛ́ mot ngɔt. Sa Zɛɛb nakɛk kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu Klisto náá, nyɛ waadjɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɛ, biyɔ pe aabaabela yɛ.<verse eid="EPH 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>Dum nɛ ɛkɛɛ Zɛɛb nadjɛ mɛ ɛ, mɛ moo ɛ́ mot-mɛsa mɛ étɛp ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. Nyɛ nasa deenek tɔ lam ɛ, nɛ ghwyil mɛbwala mɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Ye nakozoodi náá, mam tok vaŋ mot tɔ lɔɔg bot djas zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔɔ. E di'enek, Zɛɛb eesa mɛ enɛm ɛgoola nɛ bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ, mɛvu ɛ Klisto di ààsi ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>Nyɛ eebaasa mɛ enɛm étɛp mɛ neelyaal nɛ bot djas dáa ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb nadi tɔ sɔ aasael ɛ. Nyɛy mot di nakusel esa binek djas ɔ. Nyɛ naasa náá, ye di tɔ sɔ kɛkum ɛwala bot di mos'aak. <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>Nenak yak, Zɛɛb naatel yɛ tɔ zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala etɛɛ náá, efofop nɛ dhiiti eghwyil mɛbwala di tɔ gwoo ɔ, bɛ neegu, mɛbɔk mɛ mbi mɛ etsoŋ e Zɛɛb di nɛ ye ɛ́. <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>Tin, etɛp binek djas nasael ɛ dáa Zɛɛb naloolɛɛ náá, nyɛ aasa ɛ. Nyɛ nasa ye ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Tɔ ɛgwakel'ena nɛ Yezu Klisto, nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lena nɛ nɛ. Yɛ deenek ɛ mena aanàbaadi nɛ bwoo ɛtyaa sok bhwoob Zɛɛb nɛ ɛbwaalel djas. <verse eid="EPH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Etɛp tak ɛ, mɛ di elɛɛ bin náá, nàtsakeka mɛnyel étɛp mezuk mɛ mɛ di ebee kɔ ɛsu ɛ len ɛ. Tin, mezuk menek ɛ étɛp ɛdjɛ bin duma.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kwyɛl ɛ Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Ye ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ pyak mɛboŋ si sok bhwoob ɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg. <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>Ye ɛ́ nyɛy mot di ɛsuk membyak djas. <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>Deenek ɛ, mɛ ɛpedjaala nɛ nɛ náá, kɔ ɛsu ɛ mɛvu mɛ duma nyɛ di nɛ ye ɛ́. Nyɛy mot di edjɛ bin mɛghaaz e ze mɛbwala mɛ Sisim yɛ, <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>etɛɛ náá, Klisto neebela di tɔ ebhum e lyem bin, kɔ ɛsu ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb. Mɛ ɛpewaab náá, kwyɛl'en di nɛ ekaŋal étɛp bi neepyet ɛlyelɛpe. <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>Deenek ɛ bi ɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛgu ɛnyɔɛpe bi nɛ bɔɔ Zɛɛb djas. Dáa mɛbɔk, mɛdjaa, mɛvyɛɛg, nɛ mɛdim mɛ kwyɛl ɛ Klisto di ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>Ye goka ɛ́ bi ɛgu náá, kwyɛl'ɛ eedhaa esonok djas ee bot di egu ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, esimza bin neewozal kɛkum edi Zɛɛb nyɛy ɛmet di ekwyɛl ɔ.<verse eid="EPH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Ye ɛ́ Zɛɛb ɛ di nɛ ghwyil ɛsa esonok tɔ lena dum nɛ mɛbwala mɛ di esa mɛsa tɔ lena ɛ, dhaa yii mena di ewaab ɛ nɛghu yii mena di esimza ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>Betka náá, duu di nɛ Zɛɛb kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm dum nɛ sa nyɛ lyaal tɔ zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala mɛ kɔ lo ɛ Yezu Klisto! Amɛn.<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Djhoodika sama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Mam mot di mot membok, etɛɛ náá, mɛ ɛ́ mot-mɛsa ɛ Ghɛŋ ɔ. Mɛ ɛpedjaala nɛ nen, biyɔ bot ɛ Zɛɛb nadjóo ɔ, kɛka tɔ mbɛɛ mɛfulu dáa Zɛɛb di kwyɛl ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/>Dika tɔ mɛsila, dika tɔ mɛtela, dika tɔ bwood. Djiselelka pak'en nɛ kwyɛl djas. <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>Saka mɛghaaz étɛp ɛbaal ɛgwakel ee Sisim na Dɛɛ djɛ mena ɛ. Dika tɔ egwyem pak'en étɛp bi needi tɔ egwakel. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Menaka ɛ́ tyee nyel wat, ye ɛ́ Sisim na Dɛɛ wat ɛ di tɔ lena. Ye ɛ́ tyɛ wat nɛ dáa Zɛɛb nadjóo mena étɛp ɛbwaal esa ee nyɛ nakɛk mena ɛ.<verse eid="EPH 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>Ye ɛ́ nɛ Ghɛŋ ngɔt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:5">ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ wat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:5">ɛduwa Zɛɛb ɛ wat.<verse eid="EPH 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>Zɛɛb ɛ ngɔt, nyɛ ɛ́ Sɛɛg bot djas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:6">Nyɛ ɛ́ e edi djas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:6">nyɛ ɛ́ tɔ menabɛl djas.<verse eid="EPH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Mot nɛ mot pak'ena naabela yɛ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ ee Klisto nadjɛ mena nɛ lyem wat ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/>Ekwyala bɛ na dɛɛ lɛɛ ɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">«E ghɛŋ nyɛ nabyet tɔ́ pɛ tɔ gwoo ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">nyɛ naatɔ́ nɛ bot ɛ nadi é ekwom ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">nyɛ naadjɛ bot mɛkɛɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:19">Mɛd 68.19</ref>.</char></note>.»<verse eid="EPH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>Tin, ɛbyet tɔ gwoo kwyɛl lɛɛ yé? Ye kwyɛl ɛlɛɛ náá, nyɛ naasul sok tɔ esum edi na dim-dim di kɔ bɔs ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Mot nasul kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs ɔ, ye ɛ́ pe ɛ mot nabyet ɛvyɛɛgɛpe tɔ gwoo ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ neelwoodal bhwak djas. <verse eid="EPH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>Nyɛ ɛ́ nadjɛ bot mɛkɛɛ mɛ di esa náá, bɛdhiiti bot di bot ɛ lwoma, bɛdhiiti bɛngoolel ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, bɛdhiiti kadi ɛ́ bɛgoolel Mbɛɛ Bhaadal, bɛdhiiti bɛdjɛɛdel ndjaa mendjaala, bak tak kadi ɛ́ bɛlyoel. <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>Ye ɛ́ deenek ɛ, nyɛ nasa náá, bot ɛ Zɛɛb bela ghwyil ɛsa mɛsa mɛ, étɛp ɛbek ɛ nyel ɛ Klisto. <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>Ye ɛ́ deenek ɛ, menabɛlka djas aadika sama tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb nɛ ɛgu ɛ Mɔn Zɛɛb. Tin, mena kadika ɛ e boo bot dinaa, ɛtiibal ɛ lena aakum dáa yii Klisto. <verse eid="EPH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Tin, mena aanàkabaadika tyee bɔɔ dhyeeb. Mena aanàkabaadika ewo dáa mɛghwak, nɛghu mɛsim edu bɛ mɛlyo mbɛs. Sa mena ààkabaabet bot binɔk bɛ lɛɛ bot elɛŋ mɛkɔŋ étɛp ɛwa mena tɔ ɛdjak. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Tin, mena goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi nɛ kwyɛl pak'enaka, nɛ ɛlɛɛelka etsɛɛtsɛ, etɛɛ náá, mena neewyeeka dáa Klisto nyɛy mot di ɛsuk ɛ ndjaa mendjaala ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/>Yɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɛ, nyel di sa wat dinaa ye ɛ́ ɛlyelɛpe ɛ, sɛɛga ɛnyɔɛpe nɛ mɛtii mɛ nyel. Tin, é sok ekyes djas di esa mɛsa mɛ dáa edi goka ɛ, tin, nyel djas ɛpewyee, nɛ ɛbɔk tɔ kwyɛl.<verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tsik na bes yii ekeletyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Beeka sa mɛ di ebasal nɛ ɛwaab nɛ nen nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka, nàduka mɛfulu mɛ bot ɛ di ààdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. Etɛɛ náá, egeka bɔɔ tɔ́ ɛ tɔ esa e toto. <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>Tin, bɛ àànyɔ ɛmɛt etsɛɛtsɛ e Zɛɛb, ààkomɛt-mɛtak tsik na bes ee Zɛɛb di edjɛ bot ɛ, etɛɛ náá, bɛ nɛ lyel elyem. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Bɛ eezegwyiya syen, bɛ eezewa lyem «tɔɔp» tɔ mɛzɔ, batakɛsa membi mɛ esa e syen djas bɛ di emyaala nɛ ye ɛ́. <verse eid="EPH 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Yɛ kabɛ biyɔ ɔ, mbi yenek mɛfulu tok yii bi nadjek pɛ daa Klisto ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>Mɛ nɛ gu náá, bi naagwak étɛp ɛ di eliiaa dum nɛ nɛ ɛ. Bela náá, bi naazelyoaa etsɛɛtsɛ dum nɛ Yezu. <verse eid="EPH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/>Bot binɔk naalyo bin náá, bi kat mbee mɛfulu bi nadi nɛ yɛ sok ɛ. Embee mɛfulu menek ɛ, ye ɛ́ mɛkwosak mɛ etɛp esyen ee elyem men dyeebakwyɛl ɛ. Yɛ deenek ɛ, bi aabet embee mɛfulu menek dáa mot di mwas bet kaad ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>Betka náá, Sisim Zɛɛb swola mɛfulu men, <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/>ɛkɛɛ bi eebɔt kaad na bes. Tin, bi moo bot ɛ na bes. Mot na bes yenɔk kusaa ɛ dáa Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ. Deenek, etsɛɛtsɛ ɛpesa náá, nyɛ di mot epiki, mot e dɛɛ.<verse eid="EPH 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>Tin, nàsaka mɛkɔŋ, mot nɛ mot goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛlɛɛ etsɛɛtsɛ nɛ sɔ mot, etɛɛ náá, zɛɛga menabɛlka djas ɛ bot ɛ nyel wat. <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/>Eghɛŋ bi di nɛ ɛbuk ɛ, sa bi ààsyem. Ye goka ɛ́ ɛbuk ɛ len sila ɛsok nɛ dwoo nɛ sila. <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>Nàbetka náá, dim mot mɛkɔŋ be di tɔ len. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Mot djii goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkat ɛdjii. Nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsa mɛghaaz étɛp ɛsa mbɛɛ mɛsa nɛ mɛmbɔ mɔɔ. Deenek ɛ, nyɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛkwyee bot ɛ di tɔ e djel ɔ.<verse eid="EPH 4:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Deenek, sa dhiiti mot ààtuwal mbee mɛkpa tɔ nuub'en. Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛlóo ɛ embɛɛ mɛkpa di djɛ ghwyil nɛ bɛsɔ bin bot di tɔ e djel ɔ, mɛkpa mɛ di enyɔ nɛ bot ɛ di egwak yɛ ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Zɛɛb naawa bin ndem nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ yɛ. Tin, nàtuŋka Sisim yenek. Bela náá, ye ɛ́ nyɛy ɛ di elɛɛ bin náá, yɛ aadi ɛ́ nɛ dwoo dinaa Zɛɛb aadis bin tɔ mesyem men ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Nàbaalka tɔ elyem bin mɛbuk mɛ embee esonok bɛ nasa bin ɛ, nàbiyoka, sa bi aadi nɛ ɛbuk. Diska tɔ elyem bin, mɛwɔɔbela, mɛlee zɛnɔɔ e mbi esesɛɛ embee lyem djas. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/>Dika nɛ mbɛɛ lyem nɛ ghwyiikwyee nɛ bɔɔ bin, pelelka pak'en dáa Zɛɛb napel bin ɛ kɔ lo ɛ Klisto.<verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Dáa ekeletyɛ di egoka nɛ ɛkɛ ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Dáa dinaa, bi ɛ bɔɔ Zɛɛb di kwyɛl ɛ, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi dáa nyɛy. <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/>Dika tɔ kwyɛl pak'en, dáa Klisto di nɛ kwyɛl nɛ nena ɛ. Dum nɛ kwyɛl tak ɛ́, nyɛ naka nyel'ɛ ɛmet buwa pɛ daa Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ lena. Tsik'ɛ tak nabɛ ɛ́ tyee mɛnanas mɛ di nɛ mbɛɛ mɛnuub ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Nenak, bi moo ɛ́ bɔɔ Zɛɛb. Tin, sa bi ààdi tɔ mɛzɔ, sa bi ààsa edhiiti embee esonok, sa bi ààdi tɔ dɔɔb mɛvu, sa bi ààkolii-liiak tɛp tak. <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Yɛ ààgoka náá, bi lóo embee mɛkpa, mɛkpa mɛ mɛlee, mɛkpa mɛ endjemet. Deenek, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Guka náá, bot ɛ di tɔ mɛzɔ ɔ, bot ɛ di esa e dhiiti embee esonok ɔ, bot ɛ di ewyeeb esa bot ɔ, bɛ aanàkwaabela esa e lyak tɔ ɛyoŋ ɛ Klisto, ɛyoŋ ɛ Zɛɛb. Tin, ye moo ɛ́ tyee náá, bɛ ɛpeduwal bɛnaghisɛ.<verse eid="EPH 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Sa bot ààkɔɔ bin nɛ elɛŋ mɛkɔŋ. Ye ɛ́ embee esonok binek ɛ di edjɛ Zɛɛb ɛbuk kɔ bot ɛ di ààlooba nɛ nɛ ɔ. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Tin, sa bi ààkɛ sama wat nɛ mbi binɔk bot, <verse eid="EPH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>etɛɛ náá, é ghɛŋ sok bi nadi ɛ́ tɔ ghooghom, nenak kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛgwakel ɛ len nɛ Ghɛŋ, bi moo ɛ́ tɔ mɛkas etɛɛ náá, bi ɛ bot ɛ Ghɛŋ. Tin, kɛka dáa bot ɛ di tɔ mɛkas ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>Mɛ ke deenek ɛ, etɛɛ náá mɛkas mɛ tak waadjɛ mena embɛɛ esa djas, esa epiki zɛnɔɔ esa etsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>Saka mɛghaaz étɛp ɛgu sa Ghɛŋ di emyaala nɛ ye ɛ́. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Nàdika edi wat nɛ bot ɛ di esa mɛsa di ààdjɛ bhum, mɛsa mɛ di esael tɔ ghooghom ɛ. Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛpana bɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>Ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ, esa ee bot binɔk di esa tɔ ghooghom ɛ, ɛsa syen e ɛbaŋa e mis mɛ bot. <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>É sok, bot di ebaŋa sa bɛ di esa ɛ, mɛfulu mɔɔ nɛ nyen popoopwon, <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>etɛɛ náá, mɛkas ɛ di esa náá esonok djas nyen popoopwon. Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ ye di ekeaa náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">«Wɔy, mot di egɔ́ ɔ, djema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">wyɛla pak myoŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">etɛɛ náá Klisto neewa wɔ tɔ mɛkas.»<verse eid="EPH 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Tin, bi ɛ kobaka nɛ tyee bi di ekɛ ɛ. Sa bi ààkɛ tyee bot ɛ di ààbɛ nɛ etsoŋ ɔ, bi goka nɛ ɛkɛ ɛ dáa bot ɛ etsoŋ. <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/>Lelka ɛsa mɛsa nɛ lyem wat tɔ ba mɔɔ ɛpɛɛd ɛwala zedjɛa bin ɛ, etɛɛ náá, mena mooka ɛ́ é mbee mɛlu. <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Nàdika dáa bot ɛ di ààbɛ nɛ etsoŋ ɔ, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛgu ɛkwosak ɛ Ghɛŋ.<verse eid="EPH 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Nàdika tɔ elangi, etɛɛ náá, elangi ɛdhaa nyel ɔɔ, ye ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛpus mot náá, nyɛ sa etɛp mbɛs. Tin, bi goka ɛ́ bi di lwoodela nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/>Djɛelka mɛghaaz pak'en tɔ mɛdjeeb mɛ di edjɛ ɛbwaalel, nɛ mɛdjeeb di edjɛ duu nɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ mɛdjeeb mɛ Sisim di etel ɛ. Tiika, myaalaka nɛ Ghɛŋ'en nɛ lyem wat. <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Bulalka bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'ena é mɛwala djas, é edi djas nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto.<verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Moma nɛ motom tɔ ɛbá</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Biyɔ bot ɛ di elooba nɛ Klisto ɔ, dika nɛ mɛsila pak'en. <verse eid="EPH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>Boa, loobaka nɛ botom bin, dáa bi di elooba nɛ Ghɛŋ ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Saka deenek etɛɛ náá, motom ɛ di ekɔk kɔ moma, dáa Klisto di ekɔk kɔ zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala ɛ. Klisto ɛ mot di etsik zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala, ee di dáa nyel'ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Boa goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛlooba nɛ botom bɔɔ, dum nɛ etɛp djas, dáa zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala di elooba nɛ Klisto ɛ.<verse eid="EPH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>Botom, kwyɛlka bɛl bin dáa Klisto di ekwyɛl zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala ɛ, nyɛ batagwyɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>Deenek, nyɛ nakwyɛl ɛ zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala di dɛɛ, ye ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ nyɛ nadis yɛ edhuud nɛ mɛdii nɛ mɛkpa mɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>Nyɛ nakwyɛl ɛ náá, bot ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, tyaa sok bhwoob'ɛ, dáa dinaa bɛ moo ɛ́ bɛnɛm, ààbɛ nɛ ɛtɔɔn, ààbɛ nɛ di wat zekwaada. Nyɛ nakwyɛl ɛ náá, bɛ di bot ɛ na dɛɛ, étɛp ye needi ààdi nɛ mot di elii ɛbiyoɛpe dum nɛ mɛsa mɔɔ. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Deenek, botom goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkwyɛl ɛ bɛl bɔɔ ɔ, dáa bɛ di ekwyɛl mɛnyel mɔɔ met ɛ. Mot di ekwyɛl myɛl ɔ, nyɛ nɛ kwyɛl nyel'ɛ met. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>Etɛɛ náá, mot tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbhina nyel'ɛ met. E di'enek, nyɛ nɛ be nyel'ɛ ɛnyɔɛpe dáa Klisto di esa nɛ zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>Menaka ɛ́ ekyes e nyel'ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/>Ekwyala lɛɛ ɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:31">«Motom ɛ waadus tɔ ndjaa sɛɛg nɛ nyɛɛg,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:31">étɛp kɛdi sama nɛ myɛl.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:31">Bɔɔ djas bɛbá aakadi ɛ́ mot ngɔt<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Mɛk 2.24</ref>.</char></note>.»<verse eid="EPH 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Tin, ye ɛ́ boo tɛp di syela tɔ ɛlaŋel ɛlak ɛ. Ye ɛ́ deenek mɛ di elɛɛ nen náá, tɛp tak ɛ dum nɛ Klisto nɛ zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Tin, mɛ ɛpebaabal nɛ biyɔ botom, mot nɛ mot goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkwyɛl ɛ myɛl dáa nyɛ di ekwyɛl nyel ɛmet ɛ. Yɛ tyɛ wat nɛ boa mɛba, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛduwal botom bin.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Dáa bɔn di egoka nɛ ɛdi nɛ bɛbyael bɔɔ ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>Biyɔ bɔn, bi moo ɛ́ tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛlooba nɛ bɛbyael bin, etɛɛ náá, deenek ɛ́ di ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/>Ɛtiŋ ɛ mɛkɛn di ekɛ nɛ ekɛk ɛ náá:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 6:2">«Duwala soog nɛ nyoog,<verse eid="EPH 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/>etɛp djas aanyɔ nɛ nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 6:3">wɔ aabɔya kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Ɛwy 20.12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Dɛt 5.16</ref>.</char></note>»<verse eid="EPH 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>Biyɔ bɛsɛɛg ɛ bɔn, nàsaka náá, bɔɔ bin kpaa elyem. Tin, ye goka ɛ́ náá, bi wyel bɛ tɔ mbɛɛ mɛlyo nɛ ɛdul ɛ bɛ mɛlɔ nɛ sa Ghɛŋ di ààkwyɛl ɛ.<verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dáa bɛkwom di egoka nɛ ɛdi nɛ ekukuma bɔɔ ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>Biyɔ bɛkwom ɛ bot, loobaka nɛ ekukuma bin kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs nɛ ba tɔ lyem, tɔ mɛsila nɛ duu djas, nɛ lyem wat, dáa bi di elooba nɛ Klisto ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>Nàsaka mɛsa etɛɛ náá, bɛ needuwal bin. Tin, ye goka ɛ́ náá, bi sa mɛsa nɛ lyem wat dáa zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ, etɛɛ náá, bi ɛ́ bot ɛ mɛsa ɛ Klisto. Ye nakozoodi e mɛwala bɛ di ààdi tin étɛp ɛgwyák bin ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>Saka mɛsa nɛ mbɛɛ lyem ɛkɛɛ, bi sa ɛ mɛsa ɛ Ghɛŋ. Nàsaka mɛsa ɛkɛɛ náá, bi sa ɛ mɛsa mɛ mot. <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>Guka náá, wɔ nakoozodi kwom mot, nɛ gu mot di ààdi kwom ɔ, wɔ sa mbɛɛ mɛsa ɔɔ, Ghɛŋ ɛ waadjɛ wɔ efute.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>Biyɔ ekukuma, dika tyee wat nɛ ekwom bin, katka ɛbɛɛg bɛ. Guka náá, biyɔ nɛ ekwom bin, biyɔ djas ɛ bɔɔ Boo Kukuma di tɔ gwoo ɛ. Nyɛy mot di tɔ gwoo ɛ ààwa mbɛk pak bot.<verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛghɛl ɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Ɛkpa ɛ mɛsik mam ɛ náá, dika nɛ ɛgwakel nɛ Ghɛŋ, saaka ghwyil'en tɔ lɛ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ boo ghwyil. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Nɔɔka bɛghɛl, da bi ɛ bɔt ekuwa dɛɛb djas Zɛɛb di edjɛ ɛ etɛɛ náá, bi neepyet dwoo dim mot mɛkɔŋ aazɛkɔɔ bin ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Etɛɛ náá, tuub mena di duuka ɛ, ye tok tuub ghiya nɛ epuud. Mena duuka ɛ nɛ embee esisim nɛ ekukuma bɔɔ, dɔɔ nɛ mɛbwala di kɔ mbee bɔs'ak ɛ. Mena duuka ɛ nɛ embee esa ee di nɛ ghwyil tɔ gwoo ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Étɛp tak ɛ, ye goka ɛ́ bi nɔɔ bɛghɛl ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ ekuwa e dɛɛb djas. Etɛɛ náá, é ghɛŋ mbee mɛlu aatuula ɛ, bi ɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛ pyet sok bhwoob bot mɛbhuka men. Bhis bi aaduu kɛkum mɛsik ɛ, bi ɛ waapyet.<verse eid="EPH 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>Pyetka, etsɛɛtsɛ di nɛ nen dáa bhɛtɛ é kuu. Dika nɛ epiki dáa bot di ebɔt ghun ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/>Ekoko mɛko men di zii ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal di edjɛ bot egwyem ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Gheedidika nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb dáa sa di epeebal mot ɛ. Yɛ waasa náá, bi dimal du mɛkɔɔ mɛ Mbee mot. <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/>Nɔɔka tsik nyɛ nadjɛ wɔ ɛ dáa kɔtɔ dɛɛb ɛ́. Da bi ɛ baanɔɔ mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb dáa pɛl Sisim na Dɛɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>É mɛwala djas, waabka nɛ Zɛɛb tɔ membi mɛ mendjaala djas, djaalaka nɛ Zɛɛb nɛ ghwyil ɛ Sisim'ɛ. Dika ndjema tɔ mendjaala, sa bi ààkat, gheedjaalaka Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ bɔɔ Zɛɛb djas. <verse eid="EPH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Baadjaalaka Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam, étɛp nyɛ needjɛ mɛ etɛtɛ mɛkpa mɛ di egoka nɛ ɛlóo é ghɛŋ mɛ di elii ɛ, etɛɛ náá, mɛ neewyisal nɛ ààbɛ nɛ bwoo sa di syela tɔ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>Ye nakoozobɛ náá, nenak mɛ ɛ́ é mbok, mɛ ɛ́ ngoola-ngoola ɛ Yezu Klisto, nyɛ nalwom mɛ étɛp mɛ neegoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. Djaalaka nɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam, etɛɛ náá, mɛ neegoola yɛ dáa ye di egoka ɛ.<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>Tisik mɔn nyɛɛg'ena, mot di esa mɛsa mɛ Ghɛŋ tɔ ɛlooba ɔ, waalɛɛ bin dáa mɛ di ɛ, etɛɛ náá, bi neegu sa djas mɛ di sa ɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>Mɛ dhis nyɛ pɛ yebɔ ɛ, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ eezɛbaŋa bin dáa bis di pɛ kak ɛ, dɔɔ nɛ etɛɛ náá, nyɛ needjɛ bin mɛghaaz.<verse eid="EPH 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Beta náá, Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'ena nɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu Klisto djɛ biyɔ djas bɔn nyɛɛg bam egwyem. Beta náá, Zɛɛb sa náá, bi kwyɛla pak'en, nɛ náá, bi dum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb baawozal. <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Beta náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ e Zɛɛb di nɛ bot ɛ di ekwyɛl Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto nɛ lyem wat ɔ.<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
